OL,3,GNEWSAWalking and cycling path reopens  
OL,4,Aafter repair                           
OL,6,FA walking and cycling path through a   
OL,7,FLeicester park has reopened after a    
OL,8,F#325,000 repair project.               
OL,10,FThe route through Stokes Wood Park,    
OL,11,Fwhich connects Brook Mead Academy with 
OL,12,FStokes Drive and Garland Crescent, had 
OL,13,Fbeen closed after part of the path     
OL,14,Fcollapsed because of erosion, affecting
OL,15,Flocal residents and pupils.            
OL,17,FThe four-month scheme involved         
OL,18,Frebuilding the damaged section of path 
OL,19,Fand carrying out work to improve part  
OL,20,Fof Gilroes Brook, which runs through   
OL,21,Fthe park.                              
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
