OL,3,GNEWSAWalking and cycling path reopens  
OL,4,Aafter repair                           
OL,6,FAs part of the project, water from the 
OL,7,Fbrook has been diverted into a new pipe
OL,8,Fsystem and outlet, helping to protect  
OL,9,Fthe path from future erosion.          
